  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to The Shaikh Group, project Syria Track II Dialogue Initiative</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till The Shaikh Group f&#xf6;r Syria Track II Dialogue Initiative, 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support for The Shaikh Group contributes to achieving the goals within Sweden&apos;s priority area of ??peace building and strengthened dialogue in the Middle East. The purpose of the project support is to work to strengthen the conditions for a more positive development in above all the north-eastern parts of Syria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till The Shaikh Group bidrar till att uppn&#xe5; m&#xe5;len inom det f&#xf6;r Sverige prioriterade omr&#xe5;det fredsbyggande och st&#xe4;rkt dialog i Mellan&#xf6;stern. Syftet med projektst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att verka f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r en mer positiv utveckling i framf&#xf6;r allt de nord&#xf6;stra delarna av Syrien.</narrative>
  </description>
